OL,3,GNEWSAFree virtual tour launched for
OL,4,AGuernsey's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA virtual tour of Guernsey's capital
OL,7,Fhas been launched, in a bid to help
OL,8,Fpeople with dementia "reconnect with
OL,9,Fcherished memories".
OL,11,FThe free virtual experience takes
OL,12,Fviewers through locations around St
OL,13,FPeter Port, including Castle Cornet,
OL,14,Fthe harbour, the market, the library
OL,15,Fand other landmark sites.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
