OL,3,GNEWSAFree virtual tour launched for
OL,4,AGuernsey's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FDementia Friendly Guernsey said the
OL,7,Fproject reflects its ongoing commitment
OL,8,Fto developing innovative initiatives
OL,9,Fand Julie Bulpitt, trustee and
OL,10,Fco-ordinator, added they were
OL,11,F"incredibly proud" to launch the free
OL,12,Ftour.
OL,14,FShe said: "Reminiscence activities are
OL,15,Fwidely recognised as being beneficial
OL,16,Ffor people living with dementia."
